       "pray" - Plead with the gods for help. The reader may experiment with
                this command at his own choosing (and risk).
       "remove" - If the user has the ability to do so, he can remove a cursed
                  item, such as an iron ball.
       "sit" - Sit down on the space you are in. Sit in thrones at your own
